## 🚦 Critical Path to "Working Demo"

To move from **current state** to **working end-to-end flow**, these four must be done first (in order):

```
1. POST /api/applicants/add  →  returns { applicationId }
2. Fix DTO fields to match frontend payload
3. GET  /api/applicants/list
4. PATCH /api/applicants/{id}/status
```

